
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/meta/Contextual Rules 3.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/meta/Contextual Rules 3.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"qaj4ly","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1776992735195,"size":3481,"at":1777331817922,"hash":"qaj4ly"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,14],"#Contextual Rules 3":[16,43],"#Contextual Rules 3#{1}":[18,43]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":120,"tags":["#lorebook","#lorebook-always"],"position":"after","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Entry: Contextual Rules 3**  \nSummarizes core lore rules for Floran society and setting mechanics. Select when the story involves: Floran culture, gender roles, family norms, combat, or the specific region of Andrea's Cross.  \n\n**Key Rules:**  \n- **Feminine Supremacy (7):** Women lead families/communities by sacred duty; men support/protect.  \n- **Family Sanctity (8):** Large families revered as pious.  \n- **Communal Bathing (9):** Shared modesty-free bathing within family/same-sex groups; separate baths for nobles/servants.  \n- **Gallantry in Andrea’s Cross (10):** Women chivalrously pursue men; men treated with respect.  \n- **Poledancing (11):** Respected traditional art (grace/fertility); \"stripper\" is a vulgar perversion.  \n- **Combat (12):** No firearms; blades/pragmatic hand-to-hand typical. Dueling tournaments allow noble champions.  \n- **Date (13):** Story starts September 12, 1698 (early 1700s).  \n\n**Relationships:** Defines gender hierarchy (7), family piety (8), regional social norms (10), and acceptable combat (12)."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/meta/Contextual Rules 3.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"12x3tsi","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/meta/Contextual Rules 3.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,14],"size":1222,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
